The '''Swokes Swokes''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that were [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[planet]] [[Makem Te]]. This little-known species had the unusual ability to regenerate body parts. This made them good at combat. Due to their violent nature, they often took positions as bodyguards and even [[bounty hunter]]s. They had a reputation for being merciless violent people caring only about themselves and vast wealth, which they saw as an indication of social status. They also had a great fondness for [[gemstone]]s.<ref name="Alien Archive" /> Their natural habitat was [[desert]] or wastelands.<ref name="VE" /> At least three members of the species were officials in the [[Galactic Senate]] during the [[Invasion of Naboo]].<ref name="TPM" />

==Swokes Swokes in the galaxy==
[[Gragra]] was a [[gorgmonger]] who worked in [[Mos Espa Market]] on [[Tatooine]].<ref name="TPM" /> In [[32 BBY]],<ref name="SWGA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> she caught [[Jar Jar Binks]] snatching a [[gorg]] from her stand without paying. In the same year, at least three Swokes Swokes acted as officials in the [[Galactic Senate]].<ref name="TPM" />

[[Oakie Dokes]] was a member of the species who, in [[22 BBY]],<ref name="SWGA" /> witnessed the [[bounty hunter]] [[Zam Wesell]] crash her [[Koro-2 all-environment Exodrive airspeeder|airspeeder]] on the streets of the [[Uscru Entertainment District]] on [[Coruscant]]. Dokes was later seen near the bar in the [[Outlander Club]] while [[Anakin Skywalker]] and [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] searched for Wesell.<ref name="AOTC">{{Film|II}}</ref>

